# การแจ้งเตือน LINE: the one door from the internet (docs/runbooks/line-alert.md, "NAT ตรง").
# Caddy gets a real Let's Encrypt certificate for the public host (LINE refuses self-signed ones)
# and passes on only LINE's webhook POST. Every other path answers 404, so no page of the system
# is reachable from outside. The LAN keeps using Caddyfile.lan on port 8443.
{$LINE_WEBHOOK_HOST} {
	@webhook {
		method POST
		path /api/line/webhook
	}
	handle @webhook {
		reverse_proxy host.docker.internal:{$BACKOFFICE_WEB_PORT}
	}
	handle {
		respond 404
	}
}
